    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb New 4 Bedroom Houses For Sale Beside the Phoenix Park\n\nBridgemount is a new high quality residential development of 3 & 4 bedroom semi-detached houses in a mature Castleknock setting next to the Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village with excellent proximity to the City Centre.\n\nThe spacious two storey houses at Bridgemount enjoy an elegant setting adjacent to Fairhaven Park and playground as well as the parklands at Phoenix Park Racecourse with its new playground. Here, yellow and red brick facades with granite detailing rise from the tastefully landscaped grounds where all houses have private off-street cobbled driveways with gated access to rear gardens.\n\nHigh levels of air-tightness and insulation achieve A2/A3 Building Energy Ratings and all houses are wired for an electric car charging point.\nEach house has outstanding quality and attention to detail with beautiful hard-wearing finishes throughout. These include solid timber painted doors, with extra tall doors to ground floor rooms, contemporary architraves and skirting, elegant tiling, and perfectly designed under-stair storage features in most houses.\n\nLarge kitchens benefit from a separate utility room in the 4 bedroom houses while the dining rooms open to the rear garden where a generous patio provides an elegant extension of living space. Gardens are seeded and are completed with a timber garden shed and have gated access.\nWood stairs with light oak handrails lead up to the spacious landing which links to exquisite bedroom accommodation complete with large floor to ceiling wardrobes. Bathrooms and ensuites are tiled as per showhouse and offer the highest standards.\n\nHere Flynn & O'Flaherty have created an ideal setting for family living of elegant three and four bedroom semi-detached houses, beautifully presented with brick and granite detailing. Bridgemount homes benefit from excellent energy efficiency and achieve an A2 / A3 Building Energy Rating.\n\nOnsite Shops\n\nThe Phoenix Park Racecourse Neighbourhood Centre on site is anchored by Londis Racecourse foodhall.\n\nThe property comprises a 500 sq.m premises which provides residents with a convenient retail amenity including; off-licence, deli and hot food. There is also the Phoenix Park Pharmacy, Nazoo Skin & Beauty who specialise in delivering high quality skincare and beauty services, KB Coffee Shop and the Hair Room.\n\nTerms have recently been agreed with an expanding creche operator which will further enhance the offerings available to local residents.\n\nThe amenities and facilities of Castleknock are of the highest order and Bridgemount is perfectly positioned within easy walking distance of restaurants, bars, cafes, boutiques and all the great amenities of this historic village. There are excellent gyms, sports clubs, hobby and interest groups as well as easy access to the amenities of the Phoenix Park and City Centre, while the local area has some of Ireland' s best Primary and Secondary schools."
      },
